### Bug fixes

* Fix the macOS and GLIBC minimum version checks in shell installers aborting with `invalid number
  ''` when run with shells whose `printf` rejects missing arguments, such as busybox `ash` (the
  default `sh` on many NAS and embedded Linux systems). Versions with fewer than three components
  (e.g. `2.17`) are now parsed with `awk`, treating missing components as 0.

